
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "FAQs";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_GeneralLayoutPage1.cshtml";
}
<div class="container-fluid">
    @*Heading Start*@
    <div class-="row" style="background: rgb(253,247,234);">
        <div class="col-sm-10 mx-auto py-5">
            <div class="fs-3">Frequently Asked <b class="text-color1">Questions (FAQs)</b></div>
            <hr class="w-50" />
            <p>we're here to make your shopping exprience simple, secure, and hassle-free..</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    @*Heading End*@

    <div class="row py-3">
        <div class="col-sm-10 mx-auto">
            <div class="row">
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>1. How do I place an order?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Browse products, select your preferred item, choose the required quantity, and click the “Add to Cart” button. Proceed to checkout, enter your shipping details, select a payment method, and confirm your order securely.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>2. What payment methods do you accept?</b>
                        <hr />
                        We accept major credit cards, debit cards, net banking, UPI, digital wallets, and cash on delivery where available. All transactions are processed through secure payment gateways for customer safety.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>3. How can I track my order?</b>
                        <hr />
                        After your order is shipped, you will receive a tracking ID by email or SMS. You can use this tracking number on our website to monitor delivery status.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>4. What is your return policy?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Customers can return eligible products within the specified return period if items are unused and in original condition. Refunds are processed after successful inspection and approval.
                    </div>

                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>5. How long does shipping take?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Shipping times vary depending on your location and product availability. Most orders are delivered within a few business days, while remote areas may require additional delivery time.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@

                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>6. Do you offer free shipping?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Yes, free shipping is available on selected products or orders above a certain amount. Shipping charges, if applicable, are clearly displayed before completing checkout.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>7. Can I cancel my order?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Orders can be canceled before they are processed or shipped. Once the order has been dispatched, cancellation may not be possible, but return options remain available.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>8. How do I create an account?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Click on the “Sign Up” option, provide your personal details, verify your email or phone number, and create a secure password to complete registration.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>9. Is my personal information secure?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Yes, we use advanced security technologies and encryption methods to protect customer data. Your personal and payment information remains safe and confidential at all times.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>10. What should I do if I receive a damaged product?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Please contact our support team immediately with photos of the damaged item and packaging. We will review the issue and provide a replacement or refund.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>11. Do you provide customer support?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Yes, our customer support team is available to assist with orders, payments, returns, and general inquiries through email, chat, or phone services.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>12. Can I change my delivery address?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Delivery addresses can be updated before the order is shipped. Contact customer support as soon as possible to request any necessary address modifications.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>13. Are all products available in stock?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Product availability is updated regularly on our website. In rare situations, items may become unavailable after ordering, and customers will be informed promptly.
                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@
                @*faqs start*@
                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-3">
                    <div class="shadow-lg mx-auto py-3">
                        <b>14. Do you offer discounts and promotions?</b>
                        <hr />
                        Yes, we regularly provide discounts, seasonal offers, coupon codes, and special promotions. Subscribe to our newsletter to stay updated on the latest deals.


                    </div>
                </div>
                @*faqs start end*@


            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
